sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as Finance Approver Browser
  participant Screen as FinanceApprovals Screen (SPA)
  participant Routes as REST Route Layer
  participant Session as Session and Role Resolver
  participant Policy as Segregation of Duties Policy
  participant EntrySvc as Journal Entry Service
  participant EntryRepo as Entry Repository
  Browser->>Screen: navigate to /finance/approvals
  Screen->>Routes: GET /api/finance/approvals
  Routes->>Session: resolve caller identity and roles
  Session-->>Routes: identity with roles [finance-approver]
  Routes->>Policy: authorise(caller, action=view-approvals)
  Policy-->>Routes: allowed
  Routes->>EntrySvc: listSubmitted(orderBy=submittedAt asc)
  EntrySvc->>EntryRepo: findByStatus('submitted', sort=asc)
  EntryRepo-->>EntrySvc: rows [entry...]
  EntrySvc-->>Routes: submitted entries oldest first
  Routes-->>Screen: 200 JSON { entries: [...] }
  Screen-->>Browser: render approval queue table
  alt caller lacks finance-approver role
    Policy-->>Routes: denied
    Routes-->>Screen: 403 Forbidden
    Screen-->>Browser: render access denied message
  end
